        "abstract": "The processing of circuits incorporating ferrites cannot be readily achieved when soft substrates are involved and an alternative approach is needed. The present work is part of a wider study on the application of soft substrates to circuits in the 30 to 40 GHz band and has been aimed at developing a technique suitable for the manufacture of isocirculators for inclusion within a larger microstrip circuit.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
